<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<style xmlns="http://purl.org/net/xbiblio/csl" class="in-text" version="1.0" demote-non-dropping-particle="sort-only" default-locale="en-GB">
  <info>
    <title>Warwick WMS beta 1.10</title>
    <title-short>WarwickWMS</title-short>
    
    <id>http://www.zotero.org/styles/harvard-coventry-university</id>
    <!-- >
 ##### Information #####
    Hi, I am Alessandro and I created this Warwick WMS author-date style template.
    It is adapted from Coventry University by Chris Hastie. 

    Warwick WMS guideline can be found below in links. 
    >> Please verify your references and bibliography again after using this template!
    >> Don't forget to check your Zotero library master data. Most problems are located here.
    >> Feel free to update this template based on your needs, but save it under a new name!
    

    ##### Change History #####
    All changes are marked in the code below with version number for audit trial.
          ______________
    Version 1.10 : 
          - removed text-case="sentence" from title macro - TESTED AND REJECTED:
            lowercases proper nouns (Facebook -> facebook, LIFE -> life, "I am" -> "i am").
            Sentence case is maintained in Zotero master data instead.
          - . after author, corporate authors have no trailing initial (guide p4 WHO)
          - editor-as-author: " ed." no parens, singular (guide p3 edited book)
          - in-text page locator: 2019:78 without space (guide p1/p4)
          - in-text non-page locator: colon instead of comma (guide p5 Coughlan)
          - electronic article with pages keeps DOI/URL, keyed on Accessed field (guide p2 Stansfield)
          - locale: style-options before terms (CSL schema order)
          - KNOWN ISSUE: comma before & when last author is an institution.
            Upstream citeproc-js bug - literal names ignore delimiter-precedes-last
            (Juris-M/citeproc-js #248, open). No CSL fix. Workaround: enter the
            organisation in two-field mode in Zotero.
    Version 1.9 : 
          - names: no comma before & (delimiter-precedes-last="never"), confirmed
            against guide p2 Sidebotham (8 authors)
          - chapter: "In:" and editors before book title with eds. label (new macro eds-chapter)
          - title-online: . after title when no URL
          - container-title-online: . after container title before [online]
          - force eds. with period (locale term editor + label suffix in eds-chapter)
          - added space between author initials (guide p1 Altbach, P. G.)
    Version 1.9 : 
          - names: no comma before & (delimiter-precedes-last="never")
          - chapter: "In:" and editors before book title with eds. label (new macro eds-chapter)
          - title-online: . after title when no URL
          - container-title-online: . after container title before [online]
          - force eds. with period (locale term editor + label suffix in eds-chapter)
          - added space between author initials 
          - added text-case="sentence" to lower case titles (although zotero does mistakes with Brand names etc., added disclaimer to manually check)
    Version 1.8 : 
          - pages : instead of ,  (journal + book chapter)  
    Version 1.7 : 
          - cleaned up Versionfor release
    Version 1.6 : 
          - added information for Warwick WMS / iheed hand in for verification
    Version 1.5 : 
          - fixed Warwick leftover: Warwick WMS uses no quotes '' for  titles
    ______________
    Version 1.4 : 
          - IMPORTANT: fixed Coverntry leftover: (Furnham 1986, Fisher 1993) to (Furnham, 1986; Fisher, 1993)
    ______________
    Version 1.3 : 
          - Removed capitalization function as WW WMS requires small titles except first character
    ______________
    Version 1.2 : 
          - Use DOI and accessed for online journals without page / issue
    ______________
    Version 1.1 : 
          - URL without "<>"; Accessed () format
          - [online] for webpages but not for electronic articles
    ______________
    Version 1.0 : 
          - et. al. italic 
          - et al from 3 authors not 4
          - added URL for reports if available
          - changed order of Location and publisher to the end for reports
    ______________

    <link href="https://github.com/tangozwo-max/Zotero_Warwick_WMS" rel="self"/>
    <link href="http://www.zotero.org/styles/harvard-coventry-university" rel="template"/>
    <link href="https://warwick.ac.uk/services/library/students/referencing/referencing-styles/harvard-wms-referencing-guide.pdf" rel="documentation"/>
    -->
    <author>
      <name>Alessandro Cancemi</name>
      <uri>cancemial@gmail.com</uri>
    </author>
    <category citation-format="author-date"/>
    <summary>The Warwick WMS author-date style - adapted from Coventry University by Chris Hastie. Substantial changes to the XML code have been done</summary>
    <updated>2026-08-06T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <rights license="http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 License</rights>
  </info>
  <locale>
  <style-options punctuation-in-quote="false"/>
    <terms>
      <term name="edition" form="short">edn.</term>
       <term name="editor" form="short"> <!-- Version 1.9 force eds. with period -->
        <single>ed.</single>
        <multiple>eds.</multiple>
      </term>
      <term name="page" form="short"/>
      <term name="section" form="short">s.</term>
    </terms>
  </locale>
  <macro name="editor">
    <names variable="editor" delimiter=", ">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
      <label form="short" prefix=" (" suffix=")" strip-periods="false"/>
    </names>
  </macro>
    <macro name="eds-chapter"> <!-- Version 1.9 editors before book title with eds. label -->
    <names variable="editor" delimiter=", ">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never"/>
       <label form="short" prefix=" " suffix="." strip-periods="true"/> <!-- Version 1.9 force period on eds. -->
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="edby">
    <names variable="editor" delimiter=", " prefix="ed. by ">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="transby">
    <names variable="translator" delimiter=", " prefix="trans. by ">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="recipient">
    <names variable="recipient" delimiter=", " prefix="to ">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="interviewer">
    <names variable="interviewer" delimiter=", " prefix="interview by ">
      <name and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="bookauthor">
    <names variable="container-author">
      <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with="." delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
      <substitute>
        <text macro="edby"/>
      </substitute>
    </names>
  </macro>
  <macro name="author">
    <choose>
      <if type="broadcast" match="any">
        <choose>
          <if variable="container-title">
            <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </if>
          <else-if variable="title">
            <text variable="title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </else-if>
        </choose>
      </if>
      <else-if type="legislation">
        <choose>
          <if variable="container-title chapter-number" match="any">
            <text variable="title" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </if>
          <else>
            <text variable="title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </else>
        </choose>
      </else-if>
      <else>
        <names variable="author">
          <name name-as-sort-order="all" and="symbol" sort-separator=", " initialize-with=". " delimiter=", " delimiter-precedes-last="never" form="long"/> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author + added space between initials // Version 1: used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
           <label form="short" prefix=" " plural="never" strip-periods="true"/> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 as per warwick PDF: edit book marking. editor-as-author: " ed." per guide p3, no parens, singular -->
          <!-- WWMS change 1.10 replaced by line before: <label form="short" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>  -->
          <et-al font-style="italic"/> <!-- WMS change: et al italics - A.Cancemi-->
          <substitute>
            <names variable="editor"/>
            <text macro="title"/>
          </substitute>
        </names>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="author-short">
    <choose>
      <if type="broadcast" match="any">
        <choose>
          <if variable="container-title">
            <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </if>
          <else-if variable="title">
            <text variable="title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          </else-if>
        </choose>
      </if>
      <else-if type="legislation">
        <text variable="title" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
      </else-if>
      <else>
        <names variable="author">
          <name form="short" and="symbol" delimiter=", " initialize-with=". " delimiter-precedes-last="never" /> <!-- Version 1.9 removed , before & for last author // Version 1:  used & instead of AND and="text"  to and="symbol"-->
          <et-al font-style="italic"/>
          <substitute>
            <names variable="editor"/>
            <text macro="title"/>
          </substitute>
        </names>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="access">
    <group delimiter=" ">
      <group>
        <text value="Available from: "/> <!-- WMS change: Capital A and : - A.Cancemi-->
        <text variable="URL" /> <!-- WMS change: removed "<>" prefix="&lt;" suffix="&gt;" -->
      </group>
      <choose>
        <if variable="URL">
          <group prefix=" (" suffix=")">
            <text value="Accessed "/> <!-- WMS change  - A.Cancemi-->
            <date variable="accessed">
              <date-part name="day" suffix=" "/>
              <date-part name="month" suffix=" "/>
              <date-part name="year"/>
            </date>
          </group>
        </if>
      </choose>
    </group>
  </macro>
  <macro name="DOIaccess">
    <group delimiter=" ">
      <group>
        <text value="Available from: "/> <!-- WMS change: Capital A and : - A.Cancemi-->
        <choose>
          <if variable="DOI"> <!-- WMS change: In case DOI available use it, else URL -->
            <text variable="DOI" prefix="https://doi.org/"/>
            </if>
          <else>
            <text variable="URL" /> <!-- WMS change: removed "<>" prefix="&lt;" suffix="&gt;" -->
          </else>
        </choose>
      </group>
      <choose>
        <if variable="accessed">
          <group prefix=" (" suffix=")">
            <text value="Accessed "/> <!-- WMS change  - A.Cancemi-->
            <date variable="accessed">
              <date-part name="day" suffix=" "/>
              <date-part name="month" suffix=" "/>
              <date-part name="year"/>
            </date>
          </group>
        </if>
      </choose>

    </group>
  </macro>

 

  <macro name="title">
    <choose>
      <if type="bill book graphic legal_case legislation manuscript motion_picture report song webpage" match="any">
        <text variable="title" font-style="italic"  /> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 removed text-case="sentence", should be done in Zotero to manage special cases such as U.S, I, Facebook etc // WWMS change 1.9 added text-case="sentence" to lower case (although zotero does mistakes with Brand names etc. , added disclaimer ) // WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
      </if>
      <else-if variable="container-title" match="none">
        <text variable="title" font-style="italic"  /> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 removed text-case="sentence", should be done in Zotero to manage special cases such as U.S, I, Facebook etc // WWMS change 1.9 added text-case="sentence" to lower case (although zotero does mistakes with Brand names etc. , added disclaimer ) // WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
      </else-if>
      <else>
        <text variable="title"   /> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 removed text-case="sentence", should be done in Zotero to manage special cases such as U.S, I, Facebook etc // WWMS change 1.9 added text-case="sentence" to lower case (although zotero does mistakes with Brand names etc. , added disclaimer ) // WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
        <!-- WWMS change 1.5 removed tquotes="true" to not ''  titles -->
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
 
  <macro name="title-online">
    <choose>
      
      <if variable="URL" >
        <group delimiter=" ">
        
          <text macro="title"  suffix="."/> 
          <text value="[online]"/> 
        
        </group>
      </if>
      
      <else>
         <text macro="title" suffix="."/> <!-- Version 1.9 added . after title when no URL -->
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="container-title-online">
    <choose>
      <if variable="URL">
        <group delimiter=" ">
            <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" suffix="."/> <!-- Version 1.9 added . before [online] --> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
          <text value="[online]"/> 
        </group>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text variable="container-title" suffix="." font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="publisher">
    <group delimiter=": ">
      <text variable="publisher-place"/>
      <text variable="publisher"/>
    </group>
  </macro>
  <macro name="year-date">
    <choose>
      <if variable="issued">
        <date variable="issued">
          <date-part name="year"/>
        </date>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text term="no date" form="short"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="year-date-legislation">
    <choose>
      <if variable="issued">
        <group delimiter=", ">
          <date variable="issued">
            <date-part name="year"/>
          </date>
          <choose>
            <if variable="chapter-number">
              <text variable="chapter-number"/>
            </if>
            <else>
              <text variable="container-title"/>
            </else>
          </choose>
        </group>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text term="no date" form="short"/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="edition">
    <choose>
      <if is-numeric="edition">
        <group delimiter=" ">
          <number variable="edition" form="ordinal"/>
          <text term="edition" form="short" strip-periods="false"/>
        </group>
      </if>
      <else>
        <text variable="edition" suffix="."/>
      </else>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="volume">
    <group delimiter=" ">
      <label variable="volume" form="short" plural="never"/>
      <text variable="volume"/>
    </group>
  </macro>
  <macro name="pages">
    <text variable="page"/>
  </macro>
  <macro name="volumes">
    <group>
      <text variable="number-of-volumes" suffix=" "/>
      <label variable="volume" form="short" plural="always"/>
    </group>
  </macro>
  <macro name="online"> <!-- ONLINE FLAG-->
    <choose>
      <if variable="URL">
        <text value="[online]"/>
      </if>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <macro name="issued">
    <choose>
      <if type="article-newspaper article-magazine paper-conference broadcast post personal_communication interview post-weblog" match="any">
        <date variable="issued">
          <date-part name="day" suffix=" "/>
          <date-part name="month"/>
        </date>
      </if>
    </choose>
    <choose>
      <if type="broadcast paper-conference post personal_communication interview post-weblog" match="any">
        <date variable="issued">
          <date-part name="year" prefix=" "/>
        </date>
      </if>
    </choose>
  </macro>
  <citation et-al-min="3" et-al-use-first="1" disambiguate-add-year-suffix="true" disambiguate-add-givenname="true" givenname-disambiguation-rule="by-cite" name-as-sort-order="all" collapse="year">
    <!-- WMS change, from 3 authors get et al (set to et-al-min="3")-->
    <layout prefix="(" suffix=")" delimiter="; "> <!-- WMS 1.4 fix add ;-->
      <choose>
        <if locator="page">
          <group delimiter=":"> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 removed &#160; after colon, guide uses 2019:78 -->
            <group delimiter=", "> <!-- WMS 1.4 fix add ,-->
              <text macro="author-short"/>
              <text macro="year-date"/>
            </group>
            <text variable="locator"/>
          </group>
        </if>
        <else>
           <group delimiter=":&#160;"> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 colon before non-page locator per guide p5 -->
            <group delimiter=", "> <!-- WMS 1.4 fix add , -->     ← leave
              <text macro="author-short"/>
              <text macro="year-date"/>
            </group>
            <group delimiter="&#160;">                            ← leave
              <label variable="locator" form="short" strip-periods="false"/>
              <text variable="locator"/>
            </group>
          </group>
        </else>
      </choose>
    </layout>
  </citation>
  <bibliography hanging-indent="true">
    <sort>
      <key macro="author"/>
      <key macro="year-date" sort="descending"/>
      <key variable="citation-number" sort="ascending"/>
      <key variable="title"/>
    </sort>
    <layout suffix=".">
      <group delimiter=" "> 
        <text macro="author" suffix="."/> <!-- Version 1.10 . after author (corporate authors have a trailing dot, persons already have one after the name initials like J.C.) -->
        <choose>
          <if type="legislation" match="any">
            <text macro="year-date-legislation" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
          </if>
          <else>
            <text macro="year-date" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
          </else>
        </choose>
        <choose>
          <if type="bill legislation" match="any">
            <text macro="online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text variable="number"/>
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <text variable="references"/>
              <text macro="publisher"/>
              <text macro="access"/> 
              
            </group>
          </if>
          <else-if type="thesis">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <text macro="publisher"/>
              <text macro="access"/>
              
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="webpage">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="manuscript">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <text variable="archive"/>
              <text variable="archive_location"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <text macro="publisher"/>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="article-journal article-magazine article-newspaper song speech" match="any">
            <text macro="title" suffix=". "/>
            
              
            <!-- WMS CHANGE In case no pages / issue, then online article, need URL-->
            
              <choose>
                <if variable="page" match="none">
                  <group delimiter=". ">
                    <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
                    <!--  WMS change, REMOVED "[online]"    in general for journals       <text macro="online"/> -->
                    <text macro="DOIaccess" />
                    </group>
                </if>
                <else>
                    <!-- WMS CHANGE In case pages, then normal journal -->
                    <group delimiter=", ">
                      <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
                      <group delimiter=", ">
                        <text macro="issued"/>
                        <group delimiter=": "> <!-- WWMS change 1.8 changed , to : -->
                          <group delimiter=" ">
                            <text variable="volume"/>
                            <text variable="issue" prefix="(" suffix=")"/>
                          </group>
                          <text macro="pages"/>
                        </group>
                      </group>
                     </group>
                    <choose> <!-- WWMS change 1.10 electronic article with pages still needs DOI/URL (guide p2 Stansfield); keyed on Accessed field -->
                      <if variable="accessed">
                        <text macro="DOIaccess" prefix=". "/>
                      </if>
                    </choose>
                      <!--  WMS change, REMOVED "Accessed"    in general for journals     <text macro="access"/> -->
                </else>
              </choose>
            
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="broadcast" match="any">
            <choose>
              <if variable="URL">
                <text macro="online"/>
                <group delimiter=". ">
                  <text variable="publisher"/>
                  <text macro="issued"/>
                  <text macro="access"/>
                </group>
              </if>
              <else>
                <text variable="publisher"/>
                <text macro="issued" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
              </else>
            </choose>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="motion_picture" match="any">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text variable="number"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="medium" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
                <text macro="publisher"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="book graphic legal_case" match="any">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="edby"/>
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="collection-title"/>
                <text variable="collection-number"/>
                <text variable="number"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="volume"/>
              <text macro="volumes"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <text macro="publisher" prefix=" "/>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
           <else-if type="report" match="any">
             <text macro="title"  suffix="."/>  <!-- WMS change: swapped <text macro="title-online"/> - A.Cancemi-->
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="edby"/>
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="collection-title"/>
                <text variable="collection-number"/>
                <text variable="number"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="volume"/>
              <text macro="volumes"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <text macro="access"/> <!-- WMS change: swapped access and publisher - A.Cancemi-->
              <text macro="publisher"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="chapter" match="any">
             <group suffix="." delimiter=" ">
              <text macro="title"/>
            </group>
            <group delimiter=" ">
              <text value="In:"/> <!-- Version 1.9 was <text term="in" suffix=" "/> -->
              <text macro="eds-chapter"/> <!-- Version 1.9 editors moved before book title, replaces bookauthor -->
              <text macro="container-title-online"/>
            </group>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="collection-title"/>
                <text variable="collection-number"/>
                <text variable="number"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="volume"/>
              <text macro="volumes"/>
              <text macro="issued"/>
              <group delimiter=": "> <!-- WWMS change 1.8 changed , to : -->
                <text macro="publisher"/>
                <text macro="pages"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="paper-conference" match="any">
            <text macro="title" prefix=" " suffix="."/>
            <group delimiter=" ">
              <choose>
                <if variable="title">
                  <text term="in" suffix=" "/>
                </if>
              </choose>
              <text macro="editor"/>
              <choose>
                <if variable="URL" match="any">
                  <group delimiter=", ">
                    <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
                    <text variable="event" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.5 removed tquotes="true" to not ''  titles -->  
                  </group>
                  <text macro="online"/>
                </if>
                <else>
                  <group delimiter=", " suffix=".">
                    <text variable="container-title" font-style="italic" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.3 removed text-case="title" to not capitalise titles -->
                    <text variable="event" /> <!-- WWMS change 1.5 removed tquotes="true" to not ''  titles -->  
                  </group>
                </else>
              </choose>
            </group>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text macro="issued" prefix="held "/>
                <text variable="publisher-place" prefix="at "/>
              </group>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text variable="publisher"/>
                <text macro="pages"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="post" match="any">
            <text macro="title"/>
            <text macro="issued" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
            <text macro="container-title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <group prefix=" ">
                <group prefix=" ">
                  <text macro="transby"/>
                  <text variable="volume"/>
                  <text variable="issue" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
                </group>
                <text macro="pages"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="personal_communication" match="any">
            <text macro="title"/>
            <text macro="online"/>
            <text variable="genre" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
            <text macro="recipient"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="issued" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="entry-encyclopedia" match="any">
            <text macro="title" suffix=". "/>
            <text macro="container-title-online" prefix="in "/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="edby"/>
              <text macro="transby"/>
              <text macro="volume"/>
              <text variable="number"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publisher"/>
                <text macro="pages"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="map" match="any">
            <text macro="title-online"/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text variable="call-number"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text variable="scale"/>
                <text variable="collection-title"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="publisher"/>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="interview" match="any">
            <group delimiter=", ">
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text macro="title" prefix=" "/>
                <text macro="interviewer" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="issued"/>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else-if type="post-weblog" match="any">
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="title"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text macro="issued" prefix="[" suffix="]"/>
                <text macro="access"/>
              </group>
            </group>
          </else-if>
          <else>
            <text macro="title" suffix=". "/>
            <text macro="container-title-online" prefix="in "/>
            <group delimiter=". ">
              <text macro="edition"/>
              <text macro="bookauthor"/>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text variable="collection-title"/>
                <text variable="collection-number"/>
                <text variable="number"/>
              </group>
              <group delimiter=" ">
                <text macro="volume"/>
                <text variable="issue" prefix=" (" suffix=")"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="volumes"/>
              <text macro="issued"/>
              <text variable="genre"/>
              <group delimiter=", ">
                <text macro="publisher"/>
                <text macro="pages"/>
              </group>
              <text macro="access"/>
            </group>
          </else>
        </choose>
      </group>
    </layout>
  </bibliography>
</style>
